        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Huh, where am I？
Everything in front of me is
white.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>......</Dialog>
          <Dialog>　　　　　　　・ 　　　　　　　・ 　　　　　　　・</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...It's clearing up little
by little.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Eh!? ▲姉ヶ崎＊▲!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Why is she here...？ Oh, I
get it. This is a dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>If it's a dream, she won't
get mad if I touch her,
right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, let's try
touching her.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>？！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...That surprised me. She
reacts even in a dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Can I touch her a little
more？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Seems like she's happy.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...She doesn't like it. So
sometimes it's a no.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It looks like she's really
enjoying it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Anegasaki</Dialog>
          <Dialog>People will see us...？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her responses are different
depending on where I touch
her.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>So depending on her mood,
there are places I can touch
and places I can't.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Looks like the number of times
I can touch her depends on her
mood, too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Where am I allowed to
touch？ Let's try.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her hair... A boyfriend's
privilege.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her forehead... Kind of
cute.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her ear... I wonder if it
tickles.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her body... I need to be
careful here.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her arm... It'd be nice to
walk arm in arm.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her hand... I want to hold
hands, too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Apparently, this won't do.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her hair, forehead, ear, body,
arm, and hand. That's about
all.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Hmm？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh, the world's going white
again... Is it over？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Just a little more...
▲姉ヶ崎＊▲, wait for
meee！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh？ Where am I？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I see, it was a dream. A
really vivid one, though.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But I can't settle for just
a dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, I'll do it
properly on our next date！</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
      </SDL2>
