        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Where is this？ There's
nobody here...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...What？ Everything's
suddenly going white.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Come to think of it, I feel
like I've had this dream
before...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa！</Dialog>
          <Dialog>▲姉ヶ崎＊▲ is so
close...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>And the mood is kind of
nice, too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>....</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Maybe I can kiss her？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Last time I could only tap
her, but this time I'll try
stroking.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her reactions change a
little depending on how I
touch her.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, this time I'll
touch just her cheek.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa, she doesn't want me
touching there？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I think it would be best not
to do that.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I'll try touching her a little
longer.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>So she's happy if I touch
her for longer.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Depending on where I touch
her, her expression will
change from time to time.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I wonder where I can touch.
I'll just try for now.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her head... Looks like I can
pat it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her forehead... Looks like I
can touch it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her cheek... I can touch here
as well.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Around her shoulders...
Seems okay here too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Not here, huh...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa, better not do that.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Her head, forehead, cheek, and
shoulder... I think I've got
it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...Hm？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Something's different...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Whoa!?</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What on earth is this...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>So I really can kiss her？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It's a dream, but is this
really okay...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But if I think of it as
practice, it should be fine.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well, what now？ Lips are the
first thing you think of when
kissing, right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>But a light kiss on her
forehead, cheek, or around
her mouth could work too,
right？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right, let's just try
it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Looks like a light touch is
best on her cheek.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A kiss on the forehead...
This could be nice too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Around her mouth... Maybe
just a light touch is best.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>A light touch on the lips
like this works too.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Except for the lips, I can't
kiss her for very long.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>...This is no good.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Oops... I got a little
carried away...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Okay, let me pull myself
together and try again.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I just need to keep touching
her lips...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It's a dream, but I'm
starting to feel weird...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It has to be longer...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No, no, I have to kiss her
lips.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>That's no good.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Phew...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Having a dream like this...
Am I frustrated or
something？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Way too embarrassing. I
can't tell ▲姉ヶ崎＊▲
about this.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Ah, everything's going white
again... So that's it.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>It's a little sad to go, but
it's only a dream...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>After a dream like this, I
can't face
▲姉ヶ崎＊▲...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>No, I just need to be able
to do it for real, not in a
dream.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>All right！ I'll do my best
on our next date！</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
